        <activityName xml:lang="en">EUR-flat pallet</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: EUR-flat pallet
Module includes only materials (no production process) and should only be used for the packing and transportation of products.;
Synonyms: stillage, Palett; 
UUID: 0669988c-64e1-3574-931e-640b8ad2f246
Includes only the materials and not the process of construction. The examined system is from gate to gate and as in most cases the paletts have a long life-span the waste treatment is not included. It must be included in the packing module
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Standard composition of materials
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: internet search 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0669988c-64e1-3574-931e-640b8ad2f246.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
